;macro for ice faerie, figures in all schools of magic to adjust for
;possibility to hit, returns damage on reflected spell if failure with
;allowance for CM skill/level
MACRO 48
IFPREVERB CAST -1
  IFVAR SPELLNUM ! 0
    RANDOM DUMMY3 1 50 0
    ADD DUMMY3 SKILL23
    ADD DUMMY3 SKILL7
    ADD DUMMY3 SKILL14
    ADD DUMMY3 SKILL17
    ADD DUMMY3 SKILL30
    DIV DUMMY3 3
    IFVAR DUMMY3 > 65
      ECHO PLAYER An ice faerie attempts to mold your mana and fails.
      ECHO OTHERS An ice faerie attempts to mold your mana and fails.
    ELSE
      equal spellnum 0
      CLEARVERB
      RANDOM DUMMY1 1 50 0
      ADD DUMMY1 LEV
      ADD DUMMY1 SKILL10
      DIV DUMMY1 4
      IFVAR DUMMY1 < 50
        ECHO PLAYER You attempt to cast your spell at the faerie.
        ECHO OTHERS %n gestures at a faerie.
        DAMAGEPLR COLD 35 The ice faerie molds the mana into an iceball and hurls it at you.
        ECHO OTHERS The ice faerie molds the mana into an iceball and hurls it at %n.
        ELSE
        ECHO PLAYER You gesture at a faerie.
        ECHO OTHERS %n gestures at a faerie.
        ECHO PLAYER The faerie molds the mana into an iceball and hurls it at you, but misses.
        ECHO OTHERS The faerie molds the mana into an iceball and hurls it at %n, but misses.
      ENDIF
    ENDIF
  ENDIF
ENDIF
IFPREVERB TARGET -1
  CLEARVERB
  ECHO PLAYER The faerie throws back her head and laughs contemptuously, shrugging off your attempt.
  ECHO PLAYER An ice faerie laughs contemptuously at %n.
ENDIF
