*DESCRIPTION_START
Luxurious snowy fur covers a long serpentine body that twists and 
wriggles on the snow and ice, propelling it at an enormous rate of 
speed. Bony ivory plates its head, protecting it and serving as a 
burrowing tool. Its maw gapes open, revealing needle-sharp fangs 
glinting with liquid that smokes and steams in the frigid air.
*DESCRIPTION_END
