*DESCRIPTION_START
The sled dog is a large furry animal whose coat protects him from the
extreme cold. He seems very comfortable in ice and snow, while heat 
and sunshine cause him to pant often. He has intelligent brown eyes 
and a white sock on one foot. He also has a very hairy tail and large 
thick, heavily furred ears.
*DESCRIPTION_END
TEXB a sled dog pads into the area.
TEXE a sled dog pads quietly into the area.
TEX1 a sled dog sits up and scratches vigorously behind his ear.
TEX2 a sled dog sniffs in circles at the ground.
TEX3 Lifting his leg, a sled dog urinates on the nearest object.
TEX4 a sled dog lifts his head and howls loudly.
TEXD growls once and falls dead.
TEXF a sled dog tucks his tail and runs
TEXM a sled dog trots
TEXA a sled dog charges
TEXR a sled dog backs off.
TEXG a sled dog takes a mouthful of snow.
