Situated underneath the start of the overhang lies a large kennel. Dogs
bark constantly, but the noise is commonplace here. Several large tie-rings
line the space next to the road, and sometimes you can find a man with his
dog team tied. A large double-door stands in the building.
*DESCRIPTION_END
