Deep inside the overhang now, lies another small building that looks to be 
a guard shack. Behind it, a small, seemingly unused, track curls back 
deeper into the overhang, its ultimate destination out of sight. There is 
an over-whelming sense of peace and quiet here. The guard shack appears 
deserted.
