*DESCRIPTION_START
Overhead, outcroppings of rock dangle towards you, the patterns in the rock 
making it appear to be liquid poured into a mold. Small icicles dangle 
pleasantly close to you, sparkling in the dim light. A large building to the 
west of the track lies almost completely under the overhang, its roof 
partially decorated with wind-driven snow. A sign hanging next to the door 
reads, "Outfitter's".
*DESCRIPTION_END
