This large shop has a full range of many winter items and clothing. Racks 
upon racks of large, thick coats, heavy tunics, and boots are displayed. 
Along the far wall lies a counter where the proprietor does the sales. A 
small shelf of tack for sled dogs rests against a back wall. A sign hangs 
from several hooks near the ceiling listing current prices.
*DESCRIPTION_END
