*DESCRIPTION_START
The overhang finally draws to an end, revealing a guard house lying
next to a small track. This track tapers off up into the forest, hugging 
its way closely against the side of the mountain. Unlike the track under 
the overhang, this one seems well used, and the snow is tramped to a shiny,
ice-covered surface. Wide enough for teams of sleds and their dogs, the
track twists and turns out of sight both towards the village and away.
*DESCRIPTION_END
