*DESCRIPTION_START
The road here starts to wind around some large, snow-covered fir trees. Small
houses line the sides of the road in a neat, yet odd pattern. More iron rings
protrude from the ground, and the marks of sleds and dogs are apparent along
the road itself. High in the mountains to the back is a distant castle. It
seems to be part of the rock, until a bit of light sparkles off a window.
There seems to be a track running down the side of the mountain that leads
to the castle.
*DESCRIPTION_END
