This room is long and divided by rows upon rows of dog runs. Each run has a
small opening with a quilted flap leading out the back. Between each run
lies small shelves situated on top of concrete blocks. Small gates open
up into each run where the dogs bark in friendly greetings, tails wagging 
emphatically. Tacked to each wall, are multitudes of harness parts, gang-
lines, brass snaps, toggles, and collars.
