IFPREVERB STOMP -1
  IFVAR PASSGRD = 1
    EQUAL EXITSW -1
    EQUAL ROUNDTIME 30
    ECHO ALL You begin the long climb up the track, the crisp, cold air tingling all around.
    PLREVENT 5
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO ALL The road turns here, and then, suddenly before you is a breathtaking scene of fir trees hung with thousands upon thousands of icicles.
    PLREVENT 5
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO ALL The small track turns again, and there, finally, is the castle.
    EQUAL PASSGRD 2
    EQUAL EXITNE 3669
  ELSE
    EQUAL EXITNE -1
    EQUAL ROUNDTIME 30
    ECHO ALL You begin the descent back to the village, the snow slick under your feet.
    PLREVENT 5
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO ALL The scenes unfold around you, snowy banks, and a small icy stream, but your taste for snow seems to have lessened.
    PLREVENT 5
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO ALL Ahead, the guard shack and entrance to the village can be seen.
    EQUAL EXITSW 3653
  ENDIF
ENDIF
