EXTEND 1 woven of glistening threads
ITEM 2 250
EXTEND 2 hanging across the entire western wall
ITEM 3 1481
EXTEND 3 that once hung in the frozen chamber
ITEM 5 250
EXTEND 5 hung along the northern wall, above the thrones
*DESCRIPTION_START ITEM EXAM 1
The mural is woven to show a scene of two young girls playing by a small
frozen creek. Their skin is a glistening black color, their eyes sparkle
green as if at some secret story only they share.
*DESCRIPTION_END
*DESCRIPTION_START ITEM EXAM 2
This large tapestry seems to show several time periods. First is a scene of
bloody battle. A small black drake battles scores of Karhadian warriors.
A distinctive looking man stands on an icy hillock, his face scarred by
the claws of the drake. This scene blends into one of a young woman facing
another fearsome ebony drake, her arms outstretched in what seems to be
supplication to the scaly beast. Karhadians are running in fright and a sled
dog dangles from the mouth of the wyrm. Finally, the last scene is one of
peaceful snowy slumber, the village and castle decorated in ice that the
sunlight changes into brillant rays colored like the rainbow.
*DESCRIPTION_END
*DESCRIPTION_START ITEM EXAM 3
The gilted mural is decorated with pictures of small people with black skin
and golden hair. They are running through a wooded forest, while a large
drake shape follows. A woman with her arms outstretched faces the drake,
tinges of greenish flames flicker along her arms.
*DESCRIPTION_END
*DESCRIPTION_START ITEM EXAM 5
This newly made tapestry shows a lovely winter scene. Snowflakes fall
everywhere, each one glistening with its silver threads. A lovely woman
wearing a stunning gown of the brightest white with icy green highlights
walks down an isle to join with a smiling man. His vivid eyes glow intensely
with a passion the weaver has capture perfectly. All around the happy couple
are beautiful snow-bound trees covered with icicles gleaming in the winter sun.
*DESCRIPTION_END
;
