IFPREVERB GO 0
  CLEARVERB
  IFVAR FLAG1 ! 1
    ECHO PLAYER You can't seem to find the right crevice.
    ELSE
    CLEARVERB
    DISBAND
    EQUAL ROUNDTIME 30
    ECHO PLAYER You squeeze into the narrow crevice and begin to make your way through it.
    PLREVENT 3
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO PLAYER [Snowy Crevice]%cThe walls of the crevice are coated with ice and snow, and so close together that they nearly touch in some places.%cObvious exits: none.
    PLREVENT 3
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO PLAYER For a moment you wedge in the crevice, but the ice melt allows you to continue.
    PLREVENT 1
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO PLAYER [Snowy Crevice]%cThe walls of the crevice seem to narrow further, but ahead a light glimmers on the icy walls.%cObvious exits: none.
    PLREVENT 3
    CONTPLREVENT
    ECHO PLAYER You inch forward a few feet more, and find that the crevice has widened enough to allow easy passage.
    MOVE 3829
    ECHO OTHERS %n squeezes into a narrow crevice in the wall of the cliff.
  ENDIF
ENDIF
